    scenarioBiasEn: 'Radhika applied double attribution: she excused her own forgetfulness as situational stress, while labeling Dev’s forgetfulness as a permanent flaw in his character.',
    scenarioOptimalEn: 'Practice generous attribution: "Dev, I am hurt that the reservation wasn\'t made, but I know how exhausted you’ve been with the factory audit. Let’s order in and celebrate tonight."',
    scenarioReflectionEn: 'When your partner makes an annoying mistake, is your immediate thought about their situation or about their personality?',
